Union Of India 1973 3 The Hire-Purchase Act, 1972,  — s.7(b): Limitation on hire-purchase charges .(1) In this section,
(b)
deposit means any sum payable by the hirer under the hire-purchase agreement by way of deposit or other initial payment or credited or to be credited to him under the agreement on account of any such deposit or payment, whether that sum is to be or has been discharged by payment of money or by transfer or delivery of goods or by any other means;

